---

## Algorithms Implemented
| Algorithm | Complexity | Purpose |
|-----------|-----------|---------|
| BFS | O(V+E) | Breadth-first crawling |
| Priority Queue | O(E log V) | Best-first crawling |
| PageRank | O(k·E) | Domain ranking |
| Tarjan SCC | O(V+E) | Community detection |
| Topological Sort | O(V+E) | Dependency ordering |

---

## Troubleshooting
| Problem | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| `cmake not found` | `sudo apt install cmake` |
| `curl/curl.h not found` | `sudo apt install libcurl4-openssl-dev` |
| `make` fails | Check `g++` is installed: `sudo apt install build-essential` |
| API not reachable | Make sure `python3 api_server.py` is running |
| Empty dashboard | Run a crawl first to generate CSVs in `output/` |
